      "review_id": "ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VPZlNuNExtcVpYbXN3RRAB",
      "author": "santhi paladugu",
      "rating": 5,
      "relative_date": "a year ago",
      "text": "I’ve been struggling with acne for years and had almost given up hope—until I found Dr. Sneha. She truly gave me the best treatment I’ve ever had. Her approach was thorough, personalized, and incredibly effective. Within a few weeks, I started seeing noticeable improvement, and now my skin is clearer and healthier than ever. Dr. Sneha is not only knowledgeable but also kind and patient, taking the time to explain everything and answer all my questions. I’m so grateful for her care and would highly recommend her to anyone dealing with skin issues!",
      "has_owner_reply": false
    },
    {
      "review_id": "ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfaUo3NUZnEAE",
      "author": "sai krishna",
      "rating": 1,
      "relative_date": "a year ago",
      "text": "Visited here today and overall experience is horrible...\n\nUnclear Billing: Despite paying thousands, they provide handwritten bills that are impossible to understand. This lack of transparency in billing is unacceptable.\n\nNo Digital Bills: Refusing to provide digital bills adds to the overall lack of professionalism and transperancy...\n\nPrescription Issues: If you want to purchase medicines outside due to their high prices, they won’t disclose the names of the medicines, essentially forcing you to buy from them.\n\nLack of Concern for Patients: Once the consultation fee is paid, staff shows no interest in addressing patient concerns...\n\nThis facility lacks basic transparency and professionalism. I would not recommend it unless significant improvements are made.",
      "has_owner_reply": false
    },
